# Sipri Crypto overlay manifest.
#
# Every path that differs from upstream bcgit/bc-java must match one of the patterns below
# (git pathspec "glob" syntax). scripts/sync-upstream.sh and the sync-upstream workflow fail when
# a merge leaves any other path different from upstream - that is drift in the Bouncy Castle tree,
# which is what makes future merges conflict. Put Sipri code in the sipri/ module instead.
#
# Files listed under "modified upstream files" are upstream files Sipri edits; keep that list as
# short as possible and the edits as small as possible.

# --- Sipri-owned paths (new files, never present upstream) ---
sipri/**
SIPRI.md
.sipri-overlay
.github/README.md
.github/workflows/sipri-*.yml
scripts/sync-upstream.sh

# --- modified upstream files ---
# one appended line: include "sipri" (merged with the union driver, see sync-upstream.sh)
settings.gradle
